<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Astra.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Astra.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued three million American-style warrants on Astra shares, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    310 SEK		   ISSUE PRICE  52.85 SEK</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	21.OCT.98		 PAYDATE	12.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX APPLIED	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  309.8 SEK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
